<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s35-audit-scan> a aiprov:AuditPass ;
    rdfs:label "Audit pass over the full prose draft: every assertion checked against cited-source verification state, the graph, and the session record. Systemic finding: all 33 sources at reference-resolved only — no content checks recorded, so content-bearing citations rest on the AI's training knowledge. Specific findings: git-commit claim overstated; one citation mismatch (cost-collapse attributed to publishing-strain2024); citation-propagation extrapolation; untested ancestor-graph consolidation claim; informal division-of-labour classification presented as performed; stale self-citation ratio (4 of 31 vs current 4 of 33); MEMAS-shepard link now explicitly verified by fetch (quote found). No fixes applied — findings reported to operator"@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-24T20:52:17.425639+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code ;
    aiprov:sessionId "session_01VKCLhUZ6NZ7suGGsJp2mA4"^^xsd:string ;
    aiprov:usedTool "bash",
        "web_fetch" .

