<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s40-content-pass> a aiprov:AuditPass ;
    rdfs:label "Citation content pass over 13 shortlisted load-bearing sources: 10 promoted to ai-confirmed with quotation, access path and depth in each promotion note. Negative outcomes recorded: paper-mills2021 left at reference-resolved (publisher bot-wall, checked at title/venue/date depth only); obscurity-is-dead and fair2r-repo skipped (session repository access scoped to this project; operator-authored, human rungs are the meaningful check). Access fallbacks used and disclosed: arXiv preprint for publishing-strain2024 after publisher 403; AI Act explorer article rendering for eu-ai-act2024 (canonical ELI recorded on the source); Semantic Scholar/Europe PMC for metadata; gold-OA PDF for ai-hallucination2023; elib slide deck for provenance-overview2022."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-24T21:33:53.748706+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code ;
