<https://noheton.org/f-ai2-r/prov/activity/s44-overhead-measured> a aiprov:AuditPass ;
    rdfs:label "Method overhead measured from the session record (1,048 requests with usage at measurement time): tool-call classification attributes 100 requests (9.5 pct), 121,347 output tokens (9.0 pct), and USD 34.89 of USD 548.91 computed at list prices (6.4 pct) to method bookkeeping (provlog log/claim/validate/report/init/agent/disclosure/extract: 65 calls; promote/source: 6; graph/transcript commits: 16; transcript export: 13); 17 of 62 repository commits are graph/transcript-only. No request mixed bookkeeping with substantive work, so bounds coincide. Measured, not estimated; totals exceed the s36 cost snapshot because the session continued. Discussion paragraph updated with the shares."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-25T18:37:00.962551+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith agent:claude-code ;
